  "description": "Typed client and contracts for the Shiny.AppDeviceBridge Raspberry Pi camera bridge — cameras, JPEG snapshots, captures into a file root, sensor controls and a live MJPEG stream — for a web app or tool calling a device running Shiny.AppDeviceBridge. Register with services.AddRpiCameraBridgeClient(). Also the RpiCameraFrameStream format and ReadFramesAsync, for reading a camera streamed into a plain Stream such as a Bluetooth LE L2CAP channel.",
